<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower on Thursday in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 569.16, down 3.18. Prior closing results are not comparable because of a change in the format of the index that took effect today.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 310 to 235.</p>
<p>The average price per share was unavailable due to the change in the Amex Composite index.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,539,990 compared with 28,676,825 Tuesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
